b8141d53eb40d8c8392edbb1fde85bbc05ab40890334dbf52194ce1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Phased","source_tag":"_t","target":"+相位"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3313407412a5621b3a8de957b6e75d0bfb1231d3534569f4a1988c34644e122c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28c3ec57138003982f717d9ae4a976d55ad6d3fdbc3c95e9c58e32e2738ce77e","logical_entry_identity":"522136894c766516f0c81a100e2fad0bb4d9e5d5c4470696a88b241789e1ec8c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Charged Strike","source_tag":"talent name","target":"电能打击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3e1740c97090fe25ccbb4889c6ce8ea23a5d2a768ad8430133f07041f51a26d5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28c56c08f6bd7cae0d80bb184572c0ad1be4f2e3cf78b1b9d488d1feb7f3430b","logical_entry_identity":"7c904f333e6d0c8c4389ae60765773f05baf15b38a0df474f8f50a3443a1c743","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Arcane Storm","source_tag":"_t","target":"奥术风暴"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5d169f8d3f72af5591d4b407cb2ed41b3763a9f686aac0f46bf46323aa64be75","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28c645cbe237c464a5459fc6d0c1c1acf24f77b95fdd84056dd6ba49cb7f0b7b","logical_entry_identity":"b2b99ae015fd9722ef006c37fbee01ba94910cd4771a1bac5e2078cda3dd5aad","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"prot","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"保护"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5a128c0e49ffa9763b717d88d12c5d19a2eba1b2c5c0b714acbafcad0e39bc69","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28c958321284aab05e4d02a85cb21c12a53fc99b132f7963c42a7fac2268956e","logical_entry_identity":"066bb597d17c94e5a7f29d975eedd949f8962912c5d559d6ac656780a1dfd9eb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*A grim-looking Fighter stands there, clad in mail armour and a large olive cloak. He doesn't appear hostile - his sword is sheathed.*#WHITE#\n%s, our guild has been watching you and we believe that you have potential.\nWe see that the hermetic arts have always been at the root of each and every trial this land has endured, and we also see that one day they will bring about our destruction. So we have decided to take action by calling upon Nature to help us combat those who wield the arcane.\nWe can train you, but you need to prove you are pure, untouched by the eldritch forces, and ready to fight them to the end.\nYou will be challenged against magical foes. Should you defeat them, we will teach you our ways, and never again will you be able to be tainted by magic, or use it.\n\n#LIGHT_RED#Note:  Completing this quest will forever prevent this character from using spells or items powered by arcane forces.  In exchange you'll be given access to a mindpower based generic talent tree, Anti-magic, and be able to unlock hidden properties in many arcane-disrupting items.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*一个面色阴沉的斗士站在那里，身穿锁甲，披着一件橄榄色大斗篷。他似乎没有敌意——剑还收在鞘中。*#WHITE#\n%s，我们观察了你很久，你很有潜力。\n我们看到，秘术一直是这片大地所经受的一次次磨难的根源，也看到它们终有一天会毁灭我们。因此，我们决定采取行动，借助自然之力对抗那些操纵奥术的人。\n我们可以训练你，但你必须证明自己纯洁无瑕，未受奥术力量沾染，并已准备好与之战斗到底。\n你将面对魔法敌人的挑战。若能击败他们，我们便会传授你我们的道路；从此以后，你将再也不会受魔法玷污，也无法使用魔法。\n\n#LIGHT_RED#注：完成此任务会使该角色永久无法使用法术或由奥术之力驱动的物品。作为交换，你将解锁基于精神强度的通用技能树“反魔法”，并能解锁许多反魔法物品的隐藏属性。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"649cb4c372cc51a98528e66e4c46ad653865d1602f35e9d0d8a6386123f9b10c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28cb5b5bd33463182e98e30400281a06844c234de67a73922d21e39685705e18","logical_entry_identity":"b0b27f5002faa70452c83b77e95991ba3ce298b0aec2eadd848e884f635d1489","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#Random Object#LAST#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#随机物品#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c7dacc30ba971ae17f884fe57ae044c61cdc0461284fb762c9fd2f1dad5384f5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28ce61d3c881a0abe3352acd4f1b667007579c6ffeedd57af694a9b776dec6b5","logical_entry_identity":"9b984c22d37a481544287164bb39ed4579cfc4ea665064d5da1f8cee209d4736","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Pfaugh! Her goal in life is to waste my time! Maj'Eyal? Why not Narnia or Chicago? Just as easy to send you someplace entirely fictional as Maj'Eyal. Go away.\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*Slot slams shut.*#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"呸！她的生活目标就是在浪费我的时间！马基·埃亚尔？怎么不是纳尼亚或者芝加哥？把你送到一个完全虚构的地方，和送到马基·埃亚尔一样简单。走开。\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*小洞呯的一声关上了。*#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3ff9a39146e628e735555ab8285b81dd6b44e229197b5869323f1ea8e4ed9510","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28d0f0c51a8877afa5fae205e4487179359814e71063026aa54962cc4b12c971","logical_entry_identity":"a55d735f29f7c220f62b6a4d9d73d11bf8a4ede5b09a27a6fef94d91432ad628","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":" of Toknor","source_tag":"entity name","target":"图库纳之"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3f4671b8b8f224138852e1d60efa0b994da1f82e442197c761119a309ef7e467","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28d86a1857a3fc51bb7762f007838f746d4b9e35f4114750d6a15a0e2f183a84","logical_entry_identity":"813af5f6dfecffb386cfdb55bf7b2999631092a3658309597c6cf0cf5dbcf98e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your fury becomes an unseen force that randomly lashes out at foes around you. For %d turns you strike %d (%d%% chance for %d) nearby target(s) within range %d doing %d damage and %d knockback. The number of extra strikes increases at higher talent levels.\n\t\tIn addition, your ability to channel force with this talent increases all critical damage by %d%% (currently: %d%%)\n\t\tDamage increases with your Mindpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的愤怒变成一股无形之力，猛烈鞭笞你附近的随机敌人。在 %d 回合内，你将攻击 %d （%d%% 概率攻击 %d）个半径 %d 以内的敌人，造成 %d 点伤害并击退 %d 码。额外攻击的数目随技能等级增长。\n\t\t你灌注力量的能力使你增加 %d%% 所有暴击伤害。（当前：%d%%）\n\t\t伤害受精神强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"629f10b8a024d46c81f425dea28157e7b0ebd3a98b8f1488bc5b938a36c49d6c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28d9a555f2db2d158c9068406eb84f0a34830c62c7ddfd45026f55997ec6c471","logical_entry_identity":"48ec486068a0f096194675198c449434acd00cafe62d865db65af8bfc3abdb06","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s resists the demons!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s抵抗了心魔！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f04de03778c5130c5810e583fbc2502344444c8d02da98f644bbc03e576460bc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28ddd7bffcb6abd69dc02e58eb2d0e7e58d0f46fc5e9f4412f3e53603b08ba17","logical_entry_identity":"b6bc6b8691b55cf45ad4fb81d69e72c5451c4ead2e3be8fe6a95d0687d4a4bff","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"What kind of anomaly do you prefer?","source_tag":"_t","target":"你偏好哪种异常？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"12d28fea43ba4db57f71babd0e992a43f63d6111123371571e1686c3d0fab418","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28e0e6342079fba8902d3e4af7857908e3854888242027f1d3a1a08c68940b6a","logical_entry_identity":"8ce2ca9983a6e255c6f9ec79e266e1dfd8384f88032aae4a801500cc448d1885","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"generic lite radius","source_tag":"entity name","target":"通用 光照范围"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1cf115c13c52ff8b5a197a2a40b6d932af006037bfc0b01e817a93659a0d2f46","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28e6d7da02eaf700b9790269c0a28ce1da7e805f2152a15cde4c720039a18cf6","logical_entry_identity":"f7df754fd67913f88ed9e04a48f1a429d2d3daf10eaa7a03f8ac9c56c5022fc4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Level and experience#LAST#\nEach time you kill a creature that is over your own level - 5 you gain some experience.\nWhen you reach enough experience you advance to the next level. There is a maximum of 50 levels you can gain.\nEach time you level you gain stat and talent points to use to improve your character.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#等级和经验值#LAST#\n每次击杀一个不低于你5级的生物你可以获得经验值。\n当你的经验值条满时，你可以提升到新的等级。你最多可以提升至50级。\n每提升一个等级你将获得属性和技能点数奖励，利用这些点数可以提升你的角色。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"50e0a764b7f9eb85112e5ba4eadd6461872999236be1ba31c6c131a5597ae0bd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28e86961c8ea8208e9edd184601bbf35f531ae9691557e7ff8288f93f2f20dfa","logical_entry_identity":"34deba0817d50939af2464c65e1f30bd25e3f0b3d8b5beda8ba7fd21689b2198","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target's mind has been invaded, increasing all mind damage it receives from %s by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标遭到精神入侵，提升它受到 %s 的精神伤害 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5549dd661b90003deecebff89732677f308e70c5eefb3629706176892ceaa7f4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28e8fca951a2c0eb390b5026026c079ce20f6d97376ec04b19a3b9ba893e46cc","logical_entry_identity":"2ab6bdcfa4bf0ae802c1b685ba68357d402e1da3091745ebba3682a033651f17","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"No Winter Storm Active","source_tag":"_t","target":"没有寒冰风暴"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"24423b0c3aae8a144a76e538a8978dd96829ef0b2fda4cdf07d50d79cd3bd478","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28eaa41d44619c679b08cc8d1ea905dea364ce221355f201acee3ca437b95fb4","logical_entry_identity":"7972e4e124b9c56e8b2db869d1e5ed81b583273cfb589010e8506d5356cdeb3a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* The portal is now functional and can be used to go back, although, like all portals, it is one-way only.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* 传送门现已启用，可以用它返回；不过和所有传送门一样，它只能单向通行。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2bbde13c603d288cbe38d4bfb95c56dcce1adba7425c4ed46e32f919217c4ce6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28eb346c541bcd172d6d8b1a35f8f5bf7b2b0e7846d96d7037a5fcc362c1de5e","logical_entry_identity":"64ef1dd6eb7f1bf5269f964ee666b5226c485a6eaa1c30d332d48eec003bcac1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Learn how to enhance your Deadly Poison, adding additional effects. Each level, you will learn a new kind of poison enhancement:\n\tLevel 1: Numbing Poison\n\tLevel 2: Insidious Poison\n\tLevel 3: Crippling Poison\n\tLevel 4: Leeching Poison\n\tLevel 5: Volatile Poison\n\tNew poison enhancements can also be learned from special teachers in the world.\n\tAlso increases the effectiveness of your poisons by %d%%. (The effect varies for each poison.)\n\tAdjusting your weapon coating takes no time and does not break stealth.\n\tYou may only have two poison enhancements active at once; applying a third will randomly cause one of the existing ones to be cancelled.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"学会强化致命毒素，为其附加额外效果。每投入一级，你都会学会一种新的毒素强化：\n\t等级 1：麻痹毒素\n\t等级 2：阴险毒素\n\t等级 3：致残毒素\n\t等级 4：吸血毒素\n\t等级 5：易爆毒素\n\t还能向世界中的特殊导师学习新的毒素强化。\n\t毒素效果提高 %d%%（具体效果因毒素而异）。\n\t调整武器涂层不消耗时间，也不会打破潜行。\n\t同时最多激活两种毒素强化；激活第三种时，会随机取消一种已激活的强化。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fdce65f7bd5a55d6ecfd19a411ee6579e8b9a0463ed5b73f7c767277bd049d06","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28ecd2a08ae38934db06585c0bfa0877c893e29071221572a0e054cde8f523fe","logical_entry_identity":"24f33ed65e445701e74dbf02f65a1c1fe83f880426cef417cf3f1782259e4ab5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#rng# the Flamebringer","source_tag":"_t","target":"火焰使者#rng#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"47120359973262d613000abed9f826e61163482dc6d6df84695cc7d99660e683","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28ed2e1410d1554c7dc76074c5218df48dee9c7baa5d95efda35202a8bf350f9","logical_entry_identity":"35eb58043cec3129658ffede70874cc3dd890161fe07ca72080a086a5f5cd089","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Madness has stunned the target, reducing damage by 50%%, lowering mind resistance by %d%%, putting 4 random talents on cooldown and reducing movement speed by 50%%.  While stunned talents cooldown twice as slow.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标因疯狂而被震慑，造成的伤害降低 50%%，精神抗性降低 %d%%，4 个随机技能进入冷却，移动速度降低 50%%。震慑期间，技能冷却速度减半。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"45f354286677c7c3571a7fbb2d8ed257a2081ec4a0d29d10afea79614d37af12","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"28edd928f92eefefc3014876cd0233f46f2f42b049e944bfe2234269b9108c7e","logical_entry_identity":"4b7a4ab81e5cd0fd3b4b3961d0abcedc5d01bf2809064e3d7c89f1cdac890061","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Bear Trap","source_tag":"_t","target":"-捕熊陷阱"},{"args_order":null,"call_locat